+///   the configurable `RATE_LIMIT_MAX_WAIT_SECONDS` (default 3600s) —
+///   never capped by `maxDelayMs` and never aborted.
+/// - `Retry-After` on HTTP 429: honored up to the same rate-limit cap; the
